<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  6.37 %		    C/S =  4.07%</p>
<p>	   O/N =  6.37 %		    O/N =  5.09%</p>
<p>	   T/N = 25.49 %		    T/N =  3.39%</p>
<p>		   July 3, 1997		     July 2, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  2.03 %     1 month forward =  2.37 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.38 %     2 month forward =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  2.83 %     3 month forward =  2.94 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  3.05 %     4 month forward =  3.22 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  3.26 %     5 month forward =  3.33 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  3.40 %     6 month forward =  3.40 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
